{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1147333,\"title\":\"The Case of the Missing Scene\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"The Case of The Missing Scene is a children's crime thriller that has been designed in the tradition of classic British children's films. A camera team takes pictures of rare birds from a hide when a poacher happens to get into the picture. The evidence (namely shot 63) disappears under mysterious circumstances. As always in these films, the case can only be solved with the help of a few bright children.\",\"poster\":null,\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":1951,\"runtime\":50,\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"GB\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Don Chaffey\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":25558,\"name\":\"Don Chaffey\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oP3Hz06ax8zioume0Wjmi4i0Pjj.jpg\"},{\"id\":1675514,\"name\":\"Ivor Bowyer\",\"character\":\"Tony\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1138322,\"name\":\"Susanne Gibbs\",\"character\":\"Mary\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kbuudpmlm4tpiiVnPOK6kzzLDkt.jpg\"},{\"id\":1274419,\"name\":\"Stephen Bourne\",\"character\":\"Johnny\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":214149,\"name\":\"Noel Johnson\",\"character\":\"Crawford\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q6QWVlSIXuAtrsBTodnuKFb4bks.jpg\"},{\"id\":3133338,\"name\":\"Tony Quinn\",\"character\":\"Boven the Crook\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":40958,\"name\":\"Peter Butterworth\",\"character\":\"George\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tkoFsJ8w2r9zeBtPqvcJ78pKwEc.jpg\"},{\"id\":540282,\"name\":\"Hilda Fenemore\",\"character\":\"Mrs. Blackeney\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":89899,\"name\":\"Norman Pierce\",\"character\":\"Sam\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":151035,\"name\":\"Campbell Singer\",\"character\":\"Film Producer\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dAxoHHpiXNf9lzTT6NqRf6w5lCO.jpg\"},{\"id\":1808098,\"name\":\"Geoffrey Bond\",\"character\":\"Film Editor\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":126319,\"title\":\"Ernest & Celestine\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iJPbRASktYW0I009Ktc2zUE6Fvg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1yQpY4UCaGEirYq9EqTrDvZ24KQ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Celestine is a little mouse trying to avoid a dental career while Ernest is a big bear craving an artistic outlet. When Celestine meets Ernest, they overcome their natural enmity by forging a life of crime together.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":257,\"title\":\"Oliver Twist\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zhPdYZ3x2uanhM1SyBj4CuL6hSa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tmERlurWlGtJrAMWxtaXtW1pSPy.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An orphan endures a harsh life in a workhouse before fleeing to London, where he falls in with a gang of juvenile pickpockets led by the criminal Fagin, and eventually finds a better life, exposing the cruelties of poverty and child labor in Victorian England.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":576920,\"title\":\"Silver Skates\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gZSlt41YjSTQE7ah03usHsvmWFs.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n96Mu6w9yGO3MM9yuBrYlVvc6gb.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"1899, the Christmas-time St.Petersburg. Ice-covered rivers and canals of the capital seethe with festive activities. On the eve of the new century those who should not be destined to meet, come together. They are people from different worlds: Matvey, the son of a lamplighter, whose only treasure is his silver-plated skates; Alice is the daughter of a high-ranking official dreaming of science. Each of them has his own difficult life-story, but having accidentally met they rush forward together in pursuit of their dreams.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13373,\"title\":\"Millions\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rypaIocIovS3ICLKKakMvHDDQ0T.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/le7HI4p1gWRIIZ1FdfUfyy0Cj3S.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two boys, still grieving the death of their mother, find themselves the unwitting benefactors of a bag of bank robbery loot in the week before the United Kingdom switches its official currency to the Euro. What's a kid to do?\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":495193,\"title\":\"Benji\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/79pacM3h5FoETnfuRC6O2qPfzn4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eOkbeZ658RHVt7ULoFBqmesxEYX.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two school kids strike up a friendship with an orphaned puppy named Benji. When danger befalls them and they end up kidnapped by robbers who are in over their heads, Benji and his scruffy sidekick come to the rescue.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Family\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"3AYy8fLCpRI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"W_6zPCMX_Qo\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"X1WiQxDAeV4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}